---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Lost in Thought - 404">
  <main style="max-width: 600px; margin: 4rem auto; text-align: center; padding: 0 1rem; font-family: inherit;">
    
    <!-- Pondering Mind SVG -->
    <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; display: block; opacity: 0.8;">
      <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10 4 4 0 0 1-5-5 4 4 0 0 1-5-5z"></path>
      <line x1="12" y1="12" x2="12" y2="12.01"></line>
      <line x1="8" y1="16" x2="16" y2="16"></line>
    </svg>

    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">404: The Void</h1>
    
    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <em>What is the sound of a broken link dropping into an empty database?</em> Try pondering the meaning while I figure out where the page went.
    </p>

    <a href="/" style="display: inline-block; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid currentColor;">
      Return to Reality
    </a>
    
  </main>
</Layout>